WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.060
"Preventing and Treating Essential
Hand Tremor with Diet"

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:11.640
As documented in the book
The Case of the Frozen Addicts,

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.000
a bad batch of so-called
synthetic heroin

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.720
caused, within days,
what appeared to be

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.720
advanced-stage
Parkinson’s disease.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.800
Thanks to a chemical contaminant

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.080
known as MPTP,
young men and women

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.480
were left trapped
inside their bodies,

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.160
with near complete immobility,

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.720
in some cases able
to move only their eyes.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.480
The seminal paper
describing the phenomenon

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.120
ended with the silver lining
that maybe this will help us

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.840
find the culprit in Parkinson’s.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.360
Attention turned
to a class of chemicals

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.040
called beta-carboline alkaloids

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:47.160
due to their structural
similarity to MPTP.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.000
And, indeed, higher levels
of these toxins

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.320
were found in the brain fluid
of Parkinson’s patients.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.040
In How Not to Die,
I address Parkinson’s,

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.280
since it’s one
of our leading killers,

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.600
but the most common
movement disorder

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.840
is what’s called
"essential tremor,"

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:04.600
affecting up to 1 in 25

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.400
adults older than 40,

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:08.920
and up to 1 in 5
people in their 90s.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:12.120
In addition to the potentially
debilitating hand tremor,

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.200
there can be other
neurological manifestations,

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.040
including cognitive impairment,

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.960
depression,
and sleeping problems.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.160
In medical lingo, "essential"
can mean "of unknown cause,"

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.040
like essential hypertension,

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.480
the rise in blood pressure
as we age.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.480
Just as there have been
calls for decades

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.040
to rename that phenomenon

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.160
once it became clear
that lifestyle behaviors

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.640
played a critical role,

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:37.400
there are those suggesting
we rename essential tremor

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:40.320
as we come to understand
it better as well.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.160
Identical twin studies
suggest it may only be

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.320
60 percent genetic.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:46.840
Though there have been
studies linking

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.200
the development
of essential tremor

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.200
to lead exposure,

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.360
most attention has focused

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.680
on beta-carboline alkaloids.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.320
Beta-carboline alkaloids
induce tremor

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:59.480
in a wide variety of animals,
from mice to monkeys,

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.600
that’s similar
to essential tremor in humans

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.880
both clinically
and in the type

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:04.760
of brain damage they cause.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:07.320
As such, beta-carboline
alkaloid administration

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.080
produces the main animal
model for essential tremor

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:13.600
upon which to try out new drugs.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:17.520
Harmane is the most potent
of these tremor-producing

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.240
beta-carboline alkaloids.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.400
Expose people
to high dose harmane,

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.400
and they develop tremors too;

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.440
take it away,
and the tremors disappear.

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:29.880
What if we’re exposed
to small doses over time?

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:32.520
All six studies found that
those with essential tremor

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.640
have significantly higher
levels of this toxin

00:02:34.640 --> 00:02:35.760
in their bloodstream

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.480
compared to those
without tremor-

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:40.040
five out of six
significantly so.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.880
Furthermore, the higher
the harmane levels,

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.200
the worse the tremor.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.320
The highest levels are found
in those who have both

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.560
essential tremor and cancer,

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.560
suggesting harmane
may be playing a role

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.440
in both diseases.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.400
Elevated harmane levels
have also been found

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.520
directly in the brains
of essential tremor

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:57.280
patients on autopsy.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:59.200
Due to its high fat solubility,

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.840
harmane accumulates
in brain tissue.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.640
Using a fancy brain scan called

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:06.640
"protein magnetic resonance
spectroscopic imaging,"

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:08.240
higher harmane levels
were found to be

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.960
a significant predictor

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.600
of signs of nerve degeneration
in the cerebellum,

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:15.320
the part of the brain
that controls movement.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:19.240
How do we get exposed
to these chemicals?

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.720
Small amounts of harmane
are produced endogenously

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.840
but the main source is meat.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:26.040
Beta carboline alkaloids

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.320
are a type
of heterocyclic amine,

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.360
the class of carcinogens
that are formed

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:33.040
in a high-temperature
chemical reaction

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.720
between some of the components
of muscle tissue.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.320
Under the same
cooking conditions

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:39.320
chicken may produce
the most harmane

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:42.040
(more than twice as much
as beef steak, for example),

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.520
but the highest
single per-serving levels

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.200
have been found in fried pork,

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.440
flame-broiled steak,
flame-broiled chicken,

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.400
and grilled salmon.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.760
Researchers gave people
a slice of fried turkey

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.080
and saw a bump
in harmane blood levels

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.560
within five minutes.

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.320
Five minutes?

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.480
It’s not even digested by then.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:02.840
The researchers suspect
the rapid uptake

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.000
is indicative
of significant absorption

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.760
directly through the mouth

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.400
and straight
into the bloodstream,

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:11.120
bypassing the stomach
and, most importantly,

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:14.280
bypassing the detoxifying
enzymes of the liver

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.640
before it makes it up
into our brain.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:21.080
So, if this "potent,
tremor-producing neurotoxin"

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.400
is concentrated
in "cooked muscle foods,"

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.920
is meat consumption
associated with a higher risk

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.400
of essential tremor?

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:29.960
A study
out of Columbia University

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.840
found that men
who ate the most meat

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.600
(about 1.5 servings a day)

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.880
had a whopping 21 times
the odds of essential tremor

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:40.160
compared to men who ate
closer to a half serving a day.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.720
To put that in context,

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.200
if we go back
to the original studies

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.840
on smoking and lung cancer,

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.120
we see that smoking
was only linked

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:49.320
to about 14 times the odds.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:51.960
Now, arguing against meat’s role

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:54.400
in essential tremor
through harmane exposure

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.120
is the fact that
a similar relationship

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:58.080
was not found in women,

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.920
and there appeared to be
no difference in tremor rates

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.520
between those
who preferred their meat

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:05.160
rare versus well-cooked.

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:09.440
A reverse causation
explanation was also proposed:

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.880
instead of greater
meat consumption

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.640
leading to essential tremor,

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:15.880
perhaps the essential tremor
led to greater meat consumption,

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:18.080
as a solid stable food

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.040
that may be more easily
handled with a tremulous hand.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.680
Or perhaps the elevated
harmane levels in tremor victims

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:27.800
is due to a reduced
capacity to detoxify it

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.720
or a combination
of greater intake

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.560
and lesser excretion.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.800
For those reluctant

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:34.520
to reduce their
meat consumption,

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.120
different marinades
have been tested

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:38.800
to reduce harmane production.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.320
Hibiscus extracts

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.000
seemed to make things worse

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.120
and so did red wine,

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.200
increasing formation
up to 10-fold.

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.000
However, a Caribbean marinade

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.680
and a variety
of berry extracts worked.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.600
For example,
marinating camel meat

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:54.680
in strawberry juice
for 24 hours before frying

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.440
can reduce
the formation of harmane

00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.880
by as much as 40 percent.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:01.320
Are there any
dietary treatments

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.840
once you already
have the disease?

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.920
Vanillin--the primary
fragrance compound

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.360
in vanilla extract--

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:09.520
was found to be beneficial

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.680
against beta-carboline-induced
tremors in rats,

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:29.400
but there have yet to be
any clinical studies.

